{"contents":[{"parts":[{"text":"Calculate 23 * 17. Show your work."}],"role":"user"},{"parts":[{"text":"To calculate **23 × 17**, here are three different ways to show the work:\n\n### Method 1: Standard Long Multiplication\n1.  Multiply **23** by the ones digit (**7**):\n    *   $7 \\times 3 = 21$ (Write down 1, carry the 2)\n    *   $7 \\times 2 = 14$; $14 + 2 = 16$\n    *   Result: **161**\n2.  Multiply **23** by the tens digit (**1**, which represents **10**):\n    *   Place a 0 in the ones column.\n    *   $1 \\times 3 = 3$\n    *   $1 \\times 2 = 2$\n    *   Result: **230**\n3.  Add the two results together:\n    *   $161 + 230 = 391$\n\n**Answer: 391**\n\n***\n\n### Method 2: Difference of Squares (Mental Math shortcut)\nSince 23 and 17 are both 3 units away from 20, you can use the formula $(a + b)(a - b) = a^2 - b^2$.\n*   $23 = 20 + 3$\n*   $17 = 20 - 3$\n\nCalculation:\n*   $(20 + 3)(20 - 3) = 20^2 - 3^2$\n*   $400 - 9 = 391$\n\n**Answer: 391**\n\n***\n\n### Method 3: Distributive Property (Breaking it down)\nYou can break 17 into $10 + 7$:\n*   $23 \\times 17 = 23 \\times (10 + 7)$\n*   $23 \\times 10 = 230$\n*   $23 \\times 7 = 161$ (calculated as $20 \\times 7 + 3 \\times 7$)\n*   $230 + 161 = 391$\n\n**Answer: 391**","thoughtSignature":""}],"role":"model"},{"parts":[{"text":"Now divide that result by 23"}],"role":"user"}],"generationConfig":{"candidateCount":1,"maxOutputTokens":1024,"temperature":1,"topK":3,"topP":0.95},"safetySettings":[{"category":"HARM_CATEGORY_DANGEROUS_CONTENT","threshold":"BLOCK_NONE"},{"category":"HARM_CATEGORY_HARASSMENT","threshold":"BLOCK_NONE"},{"category":"HARM_CATEGORY_HATE_SPEECH","threshold":"BLOCK_NONE"},{"category":"HARM_CATEGORY_SEXUALLY_EXPLICIT","threshold":"BLOCK_NONE"}]}HTTP/2.0 200 OK
